//first we need to create builder folder which is build-libcxx
//It build on the llvm 14.0 version


1. This is the modifed version of libcxx to build all the source files to LLVM  IR.


2. CMake configure :

cmake -S libcxx -B build-libcxx -G Ninja \
  -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \
  -DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=clang -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=clang++ \
  -DLIBCXX_CXX_ABI=none -DLIBCXX_ENABLE_ABI_LINKER_SCRIPT=OFF

3. build IR

ninja -C build-libcxx cxx_shared-ir-sink cxx_static-ir-sink


4. check  all the IR files

cat build-libcxx/ir/cxx_shared_ll_list.txt

5. Link

llvm-link @build-libcxx/ir/cxx_shared_ll.rsp -o cxx_shared.bc